# Elm Risk Solutions Theme Conventions

Custom WordPress theme. Tailwind CSS v3 + ACF Pro Flexible Content. Pattern matches impact-one-million / yellow-bolts. No page builders, no jQuery.

Figma (AXL team): https://www.figma.com/design/dG9NKdUN3mJ3uVcnQUlAkY/Elm-Risk-Wireframes
WP Engine staging env: `elmrisksolustg` ? develop against staging (no Local). Production: `elmrisksolutio` (deploys with staging on push to `main`).

**Do not copy Impact One Million layouts, header, or visual design.** Reuse only the stack and conventions.

## Workflow: Figma ? layout

When given a Figma section (via Figma MCP on **AXL**, not Simpatica), produce exactly two artefacts:

1. **Template part** at `templates/layouts/{layout_name}.php` (underscored filename matching ACF layout name)
2. **ACF layout** added to `acf-json/group_ers_page_sections.json` (keys prefixed `field_ers_{layout}_{field}`)

## Rules

- Read sub-fields with `get_sub_field()` at the top; escape at output: `esc_html()`, `esc_url()`, `wp_kses_post()` for wysiwyg.
- Images: ACF image fields return **IDs**. Render with `wp_get_attachment_image()`. Hero/above-fold: `'fetchpriority' => 'high'`; else `'loading' => 'lazy'`.
- Links: ACF link fields return `{url, title, target}` ? output all three; `rel="noopener noreferrer"` on `_blank`. Use `ers_render_link()` when convenient.
- Optional fields guard their own markup ? no empty tags.
- Tailwind utilities only. Colours/fonts via tokens in `tailwind.config.js`. Prefer tokens over arbitrary values.
- Repeating items = ACF repeater + `have_rows()` / `the_row()`.
- Layout variants = `true_false` or `select` toggling classes ? never duplicate layouts.
- Mobile-first: base = mobile, scale with `lg:`. Figma MCP is desktop ? always add mobile.
- Text domain: `elm-risk-solutions`. Wrap user-facing strings in `__()` / `esc_html_e()`.
- Figma MCP returns React/HTML ? translate to PHP partials; keep Tailwind classes.

## Don't

- No inline `<style>` / `<script>` in layout partials.
- No page builders. No new top-level templates unless required ? pages use `page.php` ? `page_sections`.
- Never commit ACF Pro zip or license keys.
- Never edit compiled `assets/css/style.css` by hand ? run `npm run build` / `watch`.
- Never port IOM section markup or ACF field keys into this theme.
